{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6XSNZ9Q8HFYJJYXG4RM4B5R"}],"opens":"The engine might declare only what cannot be written: reading a holon, following references with a guard against cycles, mapping, filtering and folding. Every other function would then be a holon of its own, written in the field, rather than something the engine declares.","restsOn":["Expressions today give only holons, so Count and Measure cannot yet be written in them."],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6XSNZ9SS47F4S5FRKCJJ6FX","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"Pure functions over a small kernel","prev":null}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6XSNZ9Q8HFYJJYXG4RM4B5R"}],"opens":"With a field that has roots, the reader might state what holds the place, the route one came by and the other routes to it, its dimensions, and what points at it, by kind. A general component for any whole might then take over from the brief's, breadcrumbs being no longer the brief's alone.","restsOn":["Native probes are not yet specified."],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6XSNZ9S39P7S1YHTD1T2QP6","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"A reader that says where you are","prev":null}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6XSNZ9RRHZ50P7313P0JFSJ"}],"opens":"A whole owns what lies beneath it in a degree that makes it a dimension, and a namespace resolves as one writes. The bar might then be a selection that slices the field to suit what is rendered, the component chosen first or the arguments first. The author said plainly that this is not known, and that curiosity about what is unsettled is good.","restsOn":["What makes a dimension is unknown."],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6XSNZ9SHDYGEM61Z3QYQBD7","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"What makes a dimension","prev":null}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6XSNZ9RJGN4DTPS989FPE57"},{"$ref":"01M6XSNZ9SPE2YVBENWXTCB5XW"}],"opens":"Results as one types, from a buffer, in a panel over the place; the address moves on Enter, and leaving keeps the draft. This is a working choice and may change: the author does not yet know the bar of their dreams.","restsOn":["How a stream is made, and its lifetime."],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6XSNZ9SWF7M63S7FMN7ZSV1","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"The bar by common sense","prev":null}
